IMPORTANT NOTE : this doc normalizes requests responses as such :

The project normalizes raw API responses into a consistent shape:

```json
{
  ok: boolean;
  code: number;
  raw: RawApiResponse;        // original response for debugging
  data?: Payload;             // typed payload on success
  message?: string;           // error message on failure
}
```

- `ok: true` + `code: 200` → success with `data`
- `ok: false` → failure with `message`

The actual API responses are in the same format as the student API :

```json
{
  "code": 200,
  "token": "optional-token",
  "message": "human-readable or empty",
  "data": { ... }
}
```

# Family / Student Endpoints

These endpoints are accessed from a family account (`typeCompte: "F"`) to retrieve data about linked students.

**Base:** `https://api.ecoledirecte.com/v3`

All authenticated requests include:

| Header | Value |
|---|---|
| `X-GTK` | Current GTK |
| `X-Token` | Current session token |
| `Cookie` | Session cookies |
| `Content-Type` | `application/x-www-form-urlencoded` |

