## List Messages

```
GET https://api.ecoledirecte.com/v3/familles/{familyId}/messages.awp?force=false&typeRecuperation={mailbox}&idClasseur={folderId}&orderBy=date&order=desc&query={query}&onlyRead=&page={page}&itemsPerPage={itemsPerPage}&getAll=0&verbe=get&v=4.96.3
```

### Path Parameters

| Param | Description |
|---|---|
| `familyId` | Family account ID |

### Query Parameters

| Param | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `typeRecuperation` | `received` | Mailbox: `received`, `sent`, `archived`, or `draft` |
| `idClasseur` | `0` | Folder ID (0 = all) |
| `query` | `""` | Search query |
| `page` | `0` | Page number (0-based) |
| `itemsPerPage` | `100` | Items per page |
| `force` | `false` | Force refresh |
| `orderBy` | `date` | Sort field |
| `order` | `desc` | Sort direction |
| `onlyRead` | `""` | Filter by read status |
| `getAll` | `0` | Get all flag |

### Body (`data=` payload)

```json
{}
```

