## Download File

```
GET https://api.ecoledirecte.com/v3/telechargement.awp?verbe=get&fichierId={fileId}&leTypeDeFichier={fileType}&v=4.96.3&cToken={cToken}
```

### Query Parameters

| Param | Description |
|---|---|
| `fichierId` | File/document ID |
| `leTypeDeFichier` | File type category (see mapping below) |
| `cToken` | Optional content token for some files |

### File Type Mapping

| Document Category | `leTypeDeFichier` value |
|---|---|
| Notes / bulletins | `Note` |
| Invoices (factures) | `Facture` |
| School life (viescolaire) | `VieScolaire` |
| Administrative | `""` (empty) |
| Inscriptions | Entry's own `type` field (e.g. `INSCR_DOC_A_SIGNER`) |
| Companies (entreprises) | `""` (empty) |

### Headers

In addition to standard headers, optional query params:
- `forceDownload`: Force download flag
- `archive`: Archive year
- `anneeArchive`: Archive year (alternative)

### Response

The response is binary file content with appropriate `Content-Type` and `Content-Disposition` headers.
